## Summary

Resolves the remaining open GitHub CodeQL code-scanning alerts (~110 findings across ~70 files) following PR #1026. Flagged backtracking regexes are replaced with linear indexOf/split scanners and shared sanitization helpers; error/response boundaries are hardened; spec-mandated constructs receive documented `codeql[]` suppressions.

