## Test plan

```bash
pnpm check -- --scope pr                       # 48/48 gates green
pnpm exec tsc --noEmit -p tsconfig.json        # clean
pnpm exec tsc -p tsconfig.actuators.json --noEmit  # clean
pnpm vitest run libs/core/html-to-markdown.test.ts libs/core/text-escaping.test.ts libs/core/video/ingest/vtt-parser.test.ts libs/core/media/native-pptx-engine/__tests__/pptx-engine.test.ts libs/core/media/xlsx-utils.numfmt.test.ts libs/core/mission/mission-gate-engine.test.ts libs/core/service/service-engine.test.ts libs/core/service/service-engine-helpers.test.ts libs/core/knowledge/knowledge-scope.test.ts libs/core/mesh/mesh-topic-registry.test.ts libs/core/mesh/mesh-message-broker.test.ts libs/core/mesh/mesh-hub-peer-messaging-adapter.test.ts libs/core/workforce/artifact-store.test.ts libs/core/actuator/deployment-adapter.test.ts libs/core/output-artifacts.test.ts libs/core/observation-distill.test.ts libs/core/surface/surface-query-helpers.test.ts libs/core/surface/surface-runtime-conversation-data.isolation.test.ts libs/actuators/meeting-actuator/src/transcript-normalize.test.ts libs/actuators/media-actuator/src/artisan/extraction-engine.test.ts libs/core/browser/browser-onboarding.test.ts libs/core/knowledge/memory-notebook.test.ts libs/core/secret/secret-bridge.test.ts libs/core/surface/surface-query.test.ts libs/core/surface/surface-runtime-orchestrator.fastpath.test.ts libs/core/surface/surface-provider-policy.test.ts  # 284 tests green
